   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sw-SA Culture Partnership Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership programme between Swedish and South African Culture organisations/institutions. Administered by Swedish National Arts Council and the South African Department of Arts and Culture (DAC).The programme started in 2004 and 3 calls for applications 2004, 05, 06. 28 projects have been granted.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbetsprojekt mellan svenska och sydafrikanska kulturorganisationer. Handl&#xe4;ggs av Statens Kulturr&#xe5;d och Sydafrikas kulturdepartement. 28 projekt har erh&#xe5;llit bidrag.</narrative>
  </description>
